"5. Build confidence handling a common retail interaction.\n"
"\n"
"#### How the Scenario Works\n"
"You’ll step into the role of a customer returning a product, while the AI "
"acts as the store employee. The AI will ask why you’re returning the item "
"and discuss available options. This practical scenario helps you master "
"polite, efficient communication in retail situations.\n"
